description: Testing conventions
globs: **/*.{test,spec}.{ts,tsx},e2e/**
alwaysApply: false
---

# Testing

- Vitest + RTL for units; Playwright for user flows
- MSW required for PokeAPI in unit tests — extend `mocks/handlers.ts`
- Fixtures in `mocks/fixtures/`; `onUnhandledRequest: 'error'` in Vitest
- E2E hits dev server; MSW is for Vitest unless explicitly added to E2E
- Test behavior, not implementation details
